            "review_title": "Review at Chú Ơi ! Grill",
            "review_text": "binycui\nHonolulu, Hawaii7 contributions\n0\nBest lamb and beef rib BBQ, along with some authentic Chinese dishes. Clean and stylish environment.\nApr 2025 • Business\nBest place to have some good bbq and cold beer, if you need some privacy they have private rooms too. I recommend lamb and beef rib skewers, some salad dishes like cucumbers and tofu salad. Sweet and sour pork was also very delicious!! Overall, I would definitely come back again. Reasonable price too.\nWritten April 19, 2025",
